hs = **8.4 m**.", "Or split: 1 × 6 + 0.4 × 6 = 6 + 2.4 = 8.4."]}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Dividing a decimal by a whole number", "p": ["8.4 ÷ 4: 84 tenths ÷ 4 = 21 tenths = **2.1 m**. Or: 8 ÷ 4 = 2 and 0.4 ÷ 4 = 0.1 → 2.1."], "table": {"head": ["Calculation", "In tenths", "Answer"], "rows": [["0.7 × 3", "7 × 3 = 21 tenths", "2.1"], ["2.5 × 4", "25 × 4 = 100 tenths", "10"], ["9.6 ÷ 3", "96 ÷ 3 = 32 tenths", "3.2"], ["4.5 ÷ 5", "45 ÷ 5 = 9 tenths", "0.9"]]}}, {"k": "try", "t": "Multiply", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m5u15s2t02", "type": "num", "prompt": "0.6 × 4?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2.4, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "6 tenths × 4.", "reason": "2.4."}}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I multiply or divide a decimal by a whole number?", "p": ["Step 1: Estimate with whole numbers.", "Step 2: Change to tenths (× 10).", "Step 3: Multiply or divide the whole numbers.", "Step 4: Change back to tenths (÷ 10); check with the estimate."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Multiply", "p": [], "q": "3.7 × 5.", "steps": [["37 × 5 = 185 tenths", ""]], "a": "18.5"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Divide", "p": [], "q": "7.2 ÷ 6.", "steps": [["72 ÷ 6 = 12 tenths", ""]], "a": "1.2"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Estimate", "p": [], "q": "Estimate 4.8 × 7.", "steps": [["5 × 7", ""]], "a": "about 35 (exact 33.6)"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Real life", "p": [], "q": "$12.60 shared by 3? (in tenths of a dollar: 126 ÷ 3)", "steps": [["126 ÷ 3 = 42 tenths", ""]], "a": "$4.20"}, {"k": "try", "t": "Divide", "p": [], "qq": {"id": "m5u15s2t03", "type": "num", "prompt": "6.3 ÷ 3?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 2.1, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true, "hint": "", "reason": "2.1."}}, {"k": "error", "t": "Losing the decimal point", "p": ["Find the first wrong line."], "q": "1.4 × 6", "lines": ["14 × 6 = 84", "Answer 84"], "bad": 1, "why": "14 is tenths, so 84 tenths = 8.4 (estimate ≈ 6).", "f